# 🚀 Codeforces A2OJ Ladders — Python Solutions

My solutions to the [A2OJ Codeforces ladders](https://earthshakira.github.io/a2oj-clientside/server/Ladders.html), written in **Python**.

**Progress: 300 / 300 problems** &nbsp;|&nbsp; Ladders 11 – 13 completed ✅

## 📊 Overview

| Ladder | Rating range | Solved | Progress |
|:--|:--|:-:|:-:|
| [Ladder 11](https://earthshakira.github.io/a2oj-clientside/server/Ladder11.html) | Codeforces Rating &lt; 1300 | 100/100 | 100% |
| [Ladder 12](https://earthshakira.github.io/a2oj-clientside/server/Ladder12.html) | 1300 ≤ Codeforces Rating ≤ 1399 | 100/100 | 100% |
| [Ladder 13](https://earthshakira.github.io/a2oj-clientside/server/Ladder13.html) | 1400 ≤ Codeforces Rating ≤ 1499 | 100/100 | 100% |

## 🔗 How to use

* Click a **problem name** to open it on Codeforces.
* Click **✅ Python** to open my solution file on GitHub.
* Expand a ladder below to see its table.

